## Implementation stage reminders

When porting a `ready-to-implement` POC: lift pure domain first, wrap with
framework boundaries, mirror proven behavior, UI last. Keep runnable POCs as
parity oracles via `/poc archive` when useful.

## Done

- **`ready-to-implement`** = Remaining gaps is empty.
- **`not-viable`** is a valid terminal outcome: record the finding that killed
  the goal and stop.
